@api = http://localhost:5085

### Create - 201 + Location
POST {{api}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Anna Kowalska", "email": "anna@example.com", "age": 25 }

### Read all - filtering, pagination, sorting
GET {{api}}/users?search=anna&page=1&pageSize=10&minAge=18&maxAge=60&sortBy=name&sortDir=asc

### Read by id - 200 / 404
GET {{api}}/users/1

### PUT - full update - 200
PUT {{api}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Anna Nowak", "email": "anna.new@example.com", "age": 26 }

### PATCH - partial update - 200
PATCH {{api}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "age": 27 }

### DELETE - 204 / 404
DELETE {{api}}/users/1

### Bad input - 400
POST {{api}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "email": "wrong-email", "age": 5 }
